### Login as a user to get token
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Test Users Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Products Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/products?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Notifications Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/notifications?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Mentorship Sessions Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/mentorship-sessions?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Inspirations Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/inspirations?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### Test Mentor Inspirations Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/inspirations/mentor?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
